    "displayName": "Red Level Contract: Save Ships at",
    "titleSource": "token_template_cleaned",
    "titleConfidence": "medium",
    "briefing": "Ship support is needed at [DefendLocationWrapperLocation] immediately. Our client’s interests in the area are under fierce attack by outlaw forces. Looking for someone who can grab their gear, a few support ships they can trust, and deploy before it’s too late. Once you arrive, I’ll send any sitrep updates your way.  \n\nDon’t mess this up. These clients are paying for and expecting top tier protection. If anything goes wrong, we could lose this contract. That’s why we’ll give the main contractor a bonus payment of [ScripAmount] MG Scrip if all goes down without a hitch.\n\nGood luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
